  "steps": [
    "Cut the kernels from the corn, scraping the cobs to get the milk.",
    "Cook the bacon in a large skillet until crisp, then remove it and drain off most of the fat.",
    "Add the butter, onion, celery and both peppers and cook until soft, about 6 minutes.",
    "Stir in the corn, cayenne, thyme, smoked paprika, salt and pepper and cook 8 to 10 minutes.",
    "Add the cream and simmer until thickened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the bacon and adjust the seasoning."
